### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health


### Register profile
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/dev/auth/register-profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kirill",
  "university": "HSE University",
  "year_of_study": 1,
  "degree_direction": "Applied Mathematics",
  "interests": ["machine_learning", "data_science", "algorithms"],
  "skills": [
    {
      "skill": "python",
      "level": "intermediate"
    },
    {
      "skill": "sql",
      "level": "beginner"
    }
  ],
  "preferred_formats": ["internship", "hackathon"],
  "available_hours_per_week": 8,
  "goals": ["find_internship", "build_portfolio"],
  "experience_level": "beginner",
  "portfolio_links": ["https://github.com/kirill1792"]
}


### Login by ID
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/dev/auth/login-by-id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1
}


### Get my profile
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/profile/me
X-Dev-User-Id: 1


### Update my profile
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/profile/me
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User-Id: 2

{
  "name": "Kirill",
  "year_of_study": 1,
  "degree_direction": "Applied Data Analysis",
  "university": "HSE",
  "experience_level": "intermediate",
  "available_hours_per_week": 12
}


### Wrong user ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/profile/me
X-Dev-User-Id: 999